[2026-06-26T17:24:25.913Z] Possible reasons for having these kinds of units are:
[2026-06-26T17:24:25.913Z] • A unit may be statically enabled by being symlinked from another unit's
[2026-06-26T17:24:25.913Z]   .wants/, .requires/, or .upholds/ directory.
